# Skill Buffer Management

1. Persist developer prompts in `.cursor/hooks/prompt_buffer.json` via BufferManager.
2. Process unprocessed buffer entries on the CronService batch cycle; mark them with `batchProcessed`.
3. Every 24 hours, extract reusable workflow skills from the prompt buffer and clean up old entries.
